The app includes TEST COINS used only as BATTLE GAME SCORE / gift animation QA.

These test coins are NOT real currency and must never be treated as real payments.

STRICT RULES:

Test coins purpose:
- add configured points to the BATTLE SCORE only
- help creator/team win the Battle
- show gift/animation when used through a gift
- update Battle score for everyone watching
- used for gift UI testing with £0 money

Strictly forbidden:
- do not connect test coins to IAP (Google/Apple)
- do not connect test coins to Stripe
- do not connect test coins to any payment system
- do not persist test coins as real balance in production wallet/money tables
- do not mix test coins with real coins
- do not use test coins in real wallet logic
- do not allow test coins to trigger real transactions
- do not send test coin events to production payment settlement
- do not treat test coins as real revenue or value
- do not pay creators for test coins (no 60/40, no GBP, no payout, no paidCoinLots)

Separation rules (do not merge):
- LIVE LIKE TAP = +1 like per tap, unlimited, £0, no battle score
- BATTLE SCREEN TAP = +5 battle points once per unique viewer per battle, £0
- TEST-COIN GIFT = animation + battle score, £0 money
- REAL PAID-COIN GIFT = animation + battle score + eligible creator revenue
- keep test coins completely separate from real coin balance
- use separate state/variable for test coins (e.g. testCoins)
- never merge testCoins with realCoins
- never subtract from real balance when using test coins
- never add test coins to real wallet

Allowed:
- simulate sending gifts using test coins
- trigger gift animations with test coins
- add battle/game score using test coins
- use local state or temporary storage for test coins
- reset test coins freely without affecting real data
- use test coins in spectator/creator QA flow
- mint with login + server password (not an admin role)

Issuance:
- signed-in user + TEST_COINS_ISSUE_PASSWORD may mint/issue test coins
- never treat minted test coins as money

Default behavior:
test coins are fake, local/server-issued for battle score + animation only, never money.
